{{PageBanner|Clb l 016 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[The Battle Cats]] and the strategy, tower defense game known as '''Metal Slug Defense,''' and later its sequel, '''Metal Slug Attack,''' spin offs of the '''Metal Slug''' (メタルスラッグ, ''Metaru Suraggu'', '''Metal Slug''') run and gun video game series, was originally held from October 6th, 2015 to November 4th, 2015. The collaboration includes an [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during the collaboration period.<br>
The game is published by [https://www.snk-corp.co.jp/ SNK Playmore].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#008000|'''Metal Slug Attack'''}} and The Battle Cats go head to head in another special collaboration with a new unit and more stages in tow!<br>
{{Color|#E500FF|'''On between November 4 (11am) and November 18 (10:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Metal Slug Attack collab units in a special Rare Capsule set!'''}}<br>
Select the Metal Slug Attack capsules for a chance at awesome units like:

[[SOL DAE ROKKER (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''SOL DAE ROKKER (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A mysterious being that guards ruins atop a tower. Deals Massive damage to Red, Angels, and Aliens (Omnistrike)<br>
[[HUGE HERMIT (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00BAFF|'''HUGE HERMIT (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Giant crab that uses tank wreckage to attack. Strong against Aliens (Area attack)<br>
[[JUPITER KING (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''JUPITER KING (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A robotic guardian who patrols secret factories. Area attacks have chance of knockback & slow vs Aliens!<br>
[[DONALD MORDEN (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00BAFF|'''DONALD MORDEN (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A charismatic ex-general plotting a coup. Super tough vs Aliens plus area attacks with knockback!<br>
[[HI-DO (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''HI-DO (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Large bomber copter used by the Morden Army. Strong vs Floating, with chance of knockback! (Area Attack)<br>
[[SV-001 (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#82318E|'''SV-001 (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
High performance one-man tank with area attack!<br>
[[ALLEN O'NEIL (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''ALLEN O'NEAL (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Survives one lethal attack!<br>
[[MARCO (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6600|'''MARCO (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance of freezing Aliens!<br>
[[TARMA (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''TARMA (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have chance of knockback vs Aliens!<br>
[[ERI (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''ERI (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deliver extra damage vs Aliens!<br>
[[FIO (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00BAFF|'''FIO (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance of slowing Alien movement!<br>
[[MARS PEOPLE (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''MARS PEOPLE (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Weakens Alien attack power!

※ Standard Battle Cats Rare and Super Rare units will also be available when drawing from this special collaboration capsule set. Drawing from other rare capsule sets during this event will not provide Metal Slug Defense collab units.<br>
※ If this capsule set does not appear, ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Metal Slug Series Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Take on limited edition crossover challenges and collect awesome collab units!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages to take on this challenge! Also, {{Color|#FF00FF|'''some stage rewards have been reset'''}}!

Clearing stages in {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Metal Slug Defense'''}} or {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Super Metal Slug Defense'''}} will give you a small chance to pick up the limited edition Rare unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''Hyakutaro!'''}}<br>
Later stages will give you a better chance of collecting Hyakutaro, or you can get a 100% chance of recruiting him by using a Treasure Radar on any stage!<br>
There are also Timed Score rewards to collect from each stage for skillful play!

※If Hyakutaro was already collected in a previous campaign, this unit cannot be collected again.<br>
※Once collected, Hyakutaro may be activated by visiting the Upgrade menu and locating it in the Rare Cats section.<br>
※ If these collab stages do not appear, ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Collab Stage METAL SLUG STRIKES available from the 2nd week of the collab!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Starting November 11'''}}, a new gauntlet stage will be playable with a new enemy SOL DAE ROKKER, the most powerful enemy in existence...!<br>
Stronger enemies appear with each increase in stage level, and stage clear rewards also vary depending on level, with a maximum of 10!

※After all stage clear attempts have been used, it will take some time before the stage can be attempted again.<br>
※Wait times can be skipped by using a Catamin A item.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this collab campaign, every day you log into the Battle Cats app will reward you with {{Color|#FF0000|'''Rare Tickets and other useful in-game items'''}}!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on 14 days of free gifts!

Visit the site below for info on Metal Slug Attack Reloaded!<br>
https://www.snk-corp.co.jp/us/games/metalslug_attack_re/

