==Trivia==

* The original run of the collab, as well as its first rerun, were specifically collaborations with Metal Slug Defense, while its second rerun was specifically a collaboration with its sequel, Metal Slug Attack, likely due to the addition of the True forms for [[JUPITER KING (Uber Rare Cat)|JUPITER KING]], [[HUGE HERMIT (Uber Rare Cat)|HUGE HERMIT]], [[DONALD MORDEN (Uber Rare Cat)|DONALD MORDEN]], and [[HI-DO (Uber Rare Cat)|HI-DO]], which are all based on variants of the units originating from Metal Slug Attack.

*The 2017 rerun most likely occurred thanks to the release of [https://www.snk-corp.co.jp/us/games/apps/metalslug_attack/ Metal Slug Attack], Metal Slug Defense's sequel.
**The Japanese 2024 rerun likely occurred because of Metal Slug Attack's shutdown, as the collab started just 3 days after Metal Slug Attack ended its' service.
*The English 2024 rerun is likely because of the release of Metal Slug Attack Reloaded, a paid version of Metal Slug Attack on consoles and PC.
**Ironically, none of the variants which the true forms added in the rerun are based on are present in Metal Slug Attack Reloaded.

